Package: inlaops
Title: Deployment, Versioning and Scoring Tools for 'inlabru' Models
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Novica", "Nakov", , "nnovica@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-7773-7718"))
  )
Description: Serves Bayesian spatial and latent Gaussian models fit with
    'inlabru' as versioned Representational State Transfer (REST)
    application programming interfaces (APIs). Includes a 'vetiver' bridge
    (versioning, REST API serving with posterior uncertainty, 'Docker'
    packaging) for 'bru' objects, a 'parsnip' model constructor scoped to
    fixed-effects models, and proper scoring rule helpers via
    inlabru::generate(), following Gneiting and Raftery (2007)
    <doi:10.1198/016214506000001437>.
